      "statement": "`app/(dashboard)/tenant-scope.ts` lives in `app/` only because it joins `modules/auth`'s and `modules/tenancy`'s private `data/` layers, which no module may cross (rule 8); the rule it applies lives in `modules/tenancy/domain/scope.ts`.",
