      "statement": "`requireScope` performs the trainer redirect itself — after narrowing to the `ok` arm and `return`ing `null` on every other arm — by comparing `resolved.profile.role === 'trainer'` and calling `redirect('/trainer')`, so no office page starts its fetch for a trainer and rule 5's server-side omission holds structurally rather than per route.",
